00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.777
So Paddy, how do users get
started of a Terraform?

00:04:29.777 --> 00:04:31.110
PADDY FORAN: Simple enough Dana.

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:33.274
Just go to terraform.io
check out the docs,

00:04:33.274 --> 00:04:35.190
and keep track of our
github repository, where

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.272
we're constantly adding new
GCP resources to Terraform.

00:04:38.272 --> 00:04:40.230
This has been fun Dana,
and I've really enjoyed

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.340
working with you on Terraform.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.440
DANA HOFFMAN: Thanks Paddy, I've
enjoyed working with you too.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.660
And I'm looking forward
to adding new resources

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.250
